---

<section id="sobre-mi" class="about">
  <div class="container about-inner">
    
    <div class="about-visual">
      <div class="helmet-card">
        <div class="helmet-bg"></div>
        <div class="racing-stripes">
          <div class="stripe"></div>
          <div class="stripe"></div>
          <div class="stripe"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-text">
      <p class="about-overtitle">Sobre mí</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        La pista es<br><span class="accent">mi hogar</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="about-desc">
        Empecé a los 7 años en un karting de iniciación y desde el primer momento supe que esto era lo mío. Cada fin de semana de carrera es una nueva oportunidad de mejorar mis tiempos, aprender de los mejores y demostrar que la edad no es un límite.
        Entreno tres veces por semana, estudio telemetría con mi padre y trabajo en el gimnasio para mejorar la resistencia.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
.about {
  padding: 120px 0;
  position: relative;
}

.about::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  top: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  width: 3px;
  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, var(--red), transparent);
}

.about-inner {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.3fr;
  gap: 80px;
  align-items: center;
}

/* Visual side */
.about-visual {
  position: relative;
}

.helmet-card {
  position: relative;
  width: 280px;
  height: 320px;
  background: var(--mid);
  border: 1px solid rgba(232, 0, 13, 0.2);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  clip-path: polygon(0 0, calc(100% - 20px) 0, 100% 20px, 100% 100%, 20px 100%, 0 calc(100% - 20px));
  overflow: hidden;
}

.helmet-bg {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background-image: url('/images/imagen9.jpg'); /* Tu imagen */
  background-size: cover;
  background-position: center;
  transition: transform 0.5s ease;
}

/* Añade esto para que el texto sea legible sobre la foto */
.helmet-bg::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(
    to bottom, 
    rgba(0,0,0,0.2), 
    rgba(0,0,0,0.7)
  );
}

/* Asegura que el contenido flote sobre el fondo */
.helmet-icon, 
.helmet-label, 
.racing-stripes {
  position: relative; 
  z-index: 2;
}

/* Opcional: Efecto de zoom en la foto al pasar el ratón */
.helmet-card:hover .helmet-bg {
  transform: scale(1.1);
}

@keyframes float {
  0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
  50% { transform: translateY(-12px); }
}

.helmet-label {
  font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
  font-size: 1.4rem;
  font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: 4px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--red);
  z-index: 1;
  margin-top: 12px;
}

.racing-stripes {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  display: flex;
  gap: 4px;
  height: 8px;
}

.stripe:nth-child(1) { flex: 1; background: var(--red); }
.stripe:nth-child(2) { flex: 2; background: var(--yellow); }
.stripe:nth-child(3) { flex: 1; background: var(--red); }

.info-card {
  position: absolute;
  background: var(--dark);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  padding: 16px 20px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  clip-path: polygon(8px 0%, 100% 0%, calc(100% - 8px) 100%, 0% 100%);
}

.info-card--circuit {
  bottom: 80px;
  right: 0;
  animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease 0.8s both;
}

.info-card--kart {
  top: 40px;
  right: 20px;
  animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease 1s both;
}

.info-icon { font-size: 1.4rem; }

.info-text {
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  color: var(--gray);
  line-height: 1.4;
}

.info-text strong {
  display: block;
  color: var(--white);
  font-weight: 700;
}

/* Text side */
.about-overtitle {
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 4px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--red);
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.about-text .section-title {
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.about-desc {
  color: var(--gray);
  line-height: 1.8;
  font-size: 1.05rem;
}

.skills-list {
  margin-top: 32px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 16px;
}

.skill-item {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 180px 1fr 40px;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
}

.skill-label {
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--gray);
}

.skill-bar {
  height: 3px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.skill-fill {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  height: 100%;
  width: var(--pct);
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--red), var(--yellow));
  transform-origin: left;
  animation: barFill 1.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.5s both;
}

@keyframes barFill {
  from { transform: scaleX(0); }
  to { transform: scaleX(1); }
}

.skill-pct {
  font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--red);
}

@keyframes fadeUp {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}

@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .about-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .about-visual { height: 340px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .skill-item { grid-template-columns: 140px 1fr 40px; }
}
</style>
